-- One row per disease, medicine, or care note from the three Patil papers.
-- Junk page-fragment titles are removed. Amounts are copied only when a page stated them.
-- Photo slides and unreadable temperature figures do not gain a made-up dose.
-- Existing approvals and medicine rows pointed at those junk pages, so they are cleared.

